CHZZK
=====

Personal Firefox WebExtension for CHZZK ad removal and highest-quality playback.

The extension icon uses the CHZZK favicon from:
https://ssl.pstatic.net/static/nng/glive/icon/favicon.png

CHZZK ad-response interoperability was cross-checked against Crackle:
https://github.com/FilteringDev/crackle (MPL-2.0)

